OL,3,GNEWSABayeux Tapestry exhibit opens
OL,4,Adoors for first time as visitors flock
OL,5,Ato the British Museum
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bayeux Tapestry has gone on public
OL,8,Fdisplay in the UK for the first time
OL,9,Fsince it was created nearly 1,000 years
OL,10,Fago
OL,12,FDoors at the British Museum have opened
OL,13,Fand tickets are sold out for the rest
OL,14,Fof the year - visitors are being
OL,15,Fgreeted by shield-wielding re-enactors
OL,17,FThe loan of the 70m (230ft) tapestry
OL,18,Fhas been almost 100 years in the
OL,19,Fmaking, and has faced some vocal
OL,20,Fopposition in France
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
